    "The veto never fired: no unrecognised frame was observed on the turn path at all, so this run is evidence about the false-refusal rate and none about the firing path against a live Claude.",
    "control_channel.selection reports 261 unrecognised frames because the census replays EVERY site through classify_terminal_snapshot; that site's own decision is prove_control_command_selection, which is colour-based and refuses on no match. The number is an artefact of one classifier applied to all sites, not a defect.",
