    "No turn here was refused, so no legitimate-turn refusal was narrowed with evidence; the window is a bound set far above the measurement rather than fitted to it.",
    "The daemon measured predates 3b44c12, which replaced the veto's `Option<(ScreenShape, u64)>` with `Option<u64>`. That commit removed a stored value nothing read and changed no behaviour, but this run did not exercise the code as it stands at that commit."
